%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Well... um...\d%K%P
「那、那个，呃…」%K%P
Right now, Toko...%K%P
今天的都子…%K%P
Ever since that day, Toko stopped hiding her feelings for\nme, so...%K%P
不，『那一天』以来的她，\n对我的感情，已然不再遮掩…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
