%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Ah...\d%K%P
「哎？啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Right...%K%P
话说回来…%K%P
I was a terrible man who had kept her waiting for over a\nmonth.%K%P
都子如果没有说谎的话，\n现在的我就是个将她的告白回复一直保留下去的无情男人吧。%K%P
No one could blame her for acting bewildered after I\nembraced her and uttered a thoughtless remark like that.%K%P
这般的我说出了『期待已久』，\n突然紧抱住她，\n给她带来困扰，也是理所当然的吧…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dL-Let's go buy the presents! After that, we can go to\nthat great sushi place on the top floor of the station.\d%K%P
「礼、我买了礼物啊礼物！\n接下来就去车站大楼，最上面一层的美味寿司店…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLooking forward to it!\nBut do escort me properly this time, Osamu.\d%K%P
「嗯，我很期待。\n今天你会好好陪我吧，理君？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dS-Sure... No problem.\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯…请多关照」%K%P
In complete contrast to what happened during Christmas --\nwhen Toko did her best to avoid anything that would bring\nattention to her being a girl -- she now acted like we\nwere on a proper date.%K%P
比起这之前…\n故意排除了女孩子感觉的圣诞夜，\n今天的都子，是一个完美的“女孩子”。%K%P
Her best coat coupled with a somewhat bashful demeanor.\nShe accepted my proposal with a smile, and...%K%P
她穿着外出用的大衣，态度温婉可人。\n满面笑容地应和着我的提案，然后…%K%P
