%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
In her gloved left hand, Toko carried the same basket she\nhad with her the last time.%K%P
她的左手上，有手套，\n还有去年约会时，提着的篮子。%K%P
I decided not to think about what was inside, despite\nbeing fully aware of the current date.%K%P
就算是对今天这个日子的涵义，再了解不过，\n我现在也没有对其中包藏之物刻意去探索…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCongratulations on passing, Toko.\d%K%P
