………%K%P
......%K%P
……%K%P
...%K%P
…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWow...\d%K%P
「呜哇…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhen did it suddenly...\d%K%P
「什么时候…」%K%P
It seemed like the world underwent a complete change\nduring the period of time we spent shopping at the mall\nand helping ourselves to some delicious, high-quality\nsushi.%K%P
我和她在购物中心里面四处游荡，\n回味着寿司店的美味余韵之时，\n外边的世界，居然发生了如此剧变。%K%P
The snow falling on East Hagimori refused to abate even\nfor a second, covering the entire town in white.%K%P
仿佛要掩埋了东萩守的白雪，\n就这样一刻都没有停下，没有减弱，\n渐渐地，街道也变成了一片白茫茫。%K%P
The buses and taxis in front of the station disappeared,\nwith only a few stranded cars still passing through the\nroad.%K%P
车站前的公交车和出租车都无影无踪了，\n道路上的车辆，也是少得可怜。%K%P
The people left behind were either hurrying inside the\nstation with worried expressions, or trying to cross the\nmassive mountains of snow to make it home on foot.%K%P
存留下的，是路旁三三两两的行人，\n好像很困扰般，离开了车站的月台，\n小心翼翼地走在回家的路上。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWow... It's a real winter wonderland.\d%K%P
「好厉害，银装素裹了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
