「作为社会人士，无法无视降雪造成的交通障碍啊…」%K%P
One's love for those dazzling crystals of white wanes very\nquickly when you end up having to take three hours to get\nto work as a result.%K%P
抵达公司就要花上３个小时，\n这种纯白而冷峻的结晶，真是想让人发发牢骚。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWe could have a snowball fight.\nOr build a snowman.\d%K%P
