%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah...\d%K%P
「是啊…」%K%P
As such, I couldn't help seeing this girl -- still\ninnocently fascinated by this phenomenon -- as a child.%K%P
所以，看着如此天真无邪发表着感想的都子，\n在我的意识里，无论如何都把她当“孩子”来看待了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut it seems to have already stopped.\nI wonder if there'll be any snow left by tomorrow\nmorning.\d%K%P
