%LC美都子
\dIn that case... Ah, let's sit down on this bench.\nWait, I'll brush the snow off.\d%K%P
「那…\n啊，那边有座椅吧？\n虽然上面盖着层雪呢」%K%P
Toko energetically brushed the snow off with her gloved\nright hand, making enough space for one person to sit\ndown.%K%P
她一边说着，\n一边用戴着手套的手拨去了积雪，\n清理出了一个人的座位。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHere you go, Osamu. Sit down.\d%K%P
「请，理君。\n这边、这边」%K%P
As I sat down, she placed her basket on my knees.%K%P
于是，她让我坐在了长椅上，\n把左手一直提着的篮子，放到了我的膝盖上。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat's this...?\d%K%P
「这个是…？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I'm not sure it's in good taste to ask that on a day\nlike this.\d%K%P
「…今天，这里面的东西，\n怎么想都只可能是那个吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry. I still lack confidence in myself.\d%K%P
「…抱歉。\n我还不是很有自信」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo matter how much confidence you lack, or how little\nawareness you have... you couldn't possibly think you\nwouldn't get at the very least obligatory chocolate, could\nyou?\d%K%P
「理君是多么没自信又没自觉啊…\n一般想来，再不济也是义理巧克力吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAhaha...\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOf course, this one's not out of obligation at all.\nI put my heart and soul into it, just for you.\d%K%P
「可是，这当然不是义理巧克力哟。\n这可是包含了一份心，还有情意的。\n只是，为了献给你」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHaha... ha...\d%K%P
「哈哈…哈…啊」%K%P
It seemed like my wishy-washy attitude made her give up on\ntrying to make this a surprise. Instead, she launched into\na detailed explanation of what was inside the basket.%K%P
面对我过度的被害妄想，\n都子最终也放弃了给我一个惊喜，\n简单明了地告诉了我篮子里的奥秘。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI love you, Osamu.\nSo please... accept this.\d%K%P
「最喜欢你了，理君。\n所以…请收下吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
She probably anticipated that I would be making my\ndecision today. As a result, this was her final\nreiteration of the claim.%K%P
她大概也察觉到了我要孤注一掷作出决定了，\n所以，这一定是她最后的固执己见了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... I'm... uh... sorry for all the excuses I made so\nfar.\d%K%P
「我说啊…\n直到今天，我都…一直在逃避，抱歉」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI promised to make my decision on the day of your exams,\nbut I ended up delaying  it for a month. I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「本来约好了的…\n在都子合格的时候，就应该做决定的。\n结果却玩了一个月的失踪，抱歉」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou couldn't do much about that.\nThere was nothing... that could've been done.\d%K%P
「那也是没办法吧。\n…没、办法吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI abandoned you in that state... I failed you as a\nguardian and a man... and even as a person.\d%K%P
「一直，让你孤零零的，一个人不停烦恼…\n作为监护人，作为男人，作为人，都是太不够格了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLook, you don't need to tell me that.\nJust open the box already. I spent all of yesterday making\nit.\d%K%P
「不要再说那些话了，把这个打开…\n这可是我好不容易做的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
Perhaps intimidated by how I was getting closer to the\npoint, Toko interrupted me again.%K%P
我的话，渐渐地迫近了核心，踌躇未定，\n而她，还在打断我的发言。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dJust take one bite. I'll listen to you after that.\d%K%P
「先咬一口…\n然后，我才会听下去」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Okay. Thank you, Toko.\d%K%P
「…我明白了。\n谢谢你，都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I undid the metallic fittings of the basket and removed\nits lid. Inside, there was a chocolate cake around the\nsize of a hand, wrapped tightly in cooking paper.%K%P
我打开篮子，掀开盖子，\n里面是烹调用纸包裹着的，\n手心大小的巧克力蛋糕。%K%P
I slowly unfolded the paper, and took the black-coated\ncake out of the basket.%K%P
慢慢地掀开纸张，\n从篮子中取出了，\n涂上了一层黑色外皮的蛋糕…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「………诶？」%K%P
On top of it... there was a message written in white\nchocolate...%K%P
蛋糕的表面上，\n用白巧克力写着一行小字…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI hate Ms. Kouno.\d%K%P
「我，最讨厌老师了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean, she's the same as me -- she loves you just as\nmuch as I do. And I couldn't forgive her for that.\d%K%P
「因为，我们是同类人。\n我和她一样，都深深地爱着你。\n所以，我不会原谅她」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut you've loved her for so long...\nAnd you continued loving her even after she abandoned\nyou...\d%K%P
「但是理君，很早以前就喜欢老师了…\n就算被抛弃，也深爱着老师…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd she loves you, too...\nShe's still head over heels for you, even though she left\nyou...\d%K%P
「老师，也爱着理君…\n明明抛弃了你，却依然用尽全力地爱着你…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd you know... it's nerve-wracking to see two people\nlike that being together, but also not -really- being\ntogether, if you know what I mean.\d%K%P
「这样的二人，距离一直都这么近，\n虽然并没有在一起，但也真是造成了不小的麻烦啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou keep looking at each other with suffering in your\neyes... it just makes me feel worse about everything...\d%K%P
「一直在身旁观望，你如此痛苦，\n我，也十分困扰啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean... I'm the same as Ms. Kouno.\nI love you. I don't want to see you suffer!\d%K%P
「所以我…\n和老师的同类人。都最爱理君了。\n再也不想让理君感到烦恼了！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo... if the only problem is that you don't have a\nchild...\d%K%P
「所以…所以…\n如若你们没有子女…\n让你的人生充满不幸…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'll be your daughter...\d%K%P
「就让我做你的女儿…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'll become... a daughter to you and Ms. Kouno!\d%K%P
「理君和老师…\n两人的女儿吧！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo... goodbye, Osamu.\nAnd I hope we'll be happy together, Dad.\d%K%P
「所以，再见了，理君…\n还有，今后…也请多多关照了…爸爸」%K%P
